<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  /* Basic styling to mimic document structure */
  body { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; }
  h1, h2 { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0.5em; }
  .header-logo { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .form-section { margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .label-field { display: inline-block; width: 150px; vertical-align: top; }
  .field-value { display: inline-block; }
  .signature-line { border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 50px; margin-bottom: 5px; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-logo">
    <!-- Placeholder for University Logo -->
    <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="University Logo" style="max-width: 150px; height: auto;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin-top: 10px;">Western University</h1>
    <h2 style="font-size: 14pt;">OF HEALTH SCIENCES</h2>
  </div>

  <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 18pt;">HEALTH CLUB</h1>
  <h2 style="text-align: center; font-size: 16pt; margin-bottom: 30px;">REIMBURSEMENT FORM</h2>

  <div class="form-section">
    <p>After completing all required fields, please forward signed form to the Office of Human Resources with receipt copy. The form may be sent via interoffice mail or emailed directly to <span data-field="contact_email">{{ contact_email }}</span>.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <p>NAME: <span class="field-value" data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span></p>
    <p>EMPLOYEE ID: <span class="field-value" data-field="employee_id">{{ employee_id }}</span></p>
    <p>DEPT: <span class="field-value" data-field="department">{{ department }}</span></p>
    <p>HEALTH CLUB: <span class="field-value" data-field="health_club_name">{{ health_club_name }}</span></p>
    <p>AMOUNT PAID: <span class="field-value" data-field="amount_paid">{{ amount_paid }}</span></p>
    <p>AMOUNT ELIGIBLE FOR REIMBURSEMENT: <span class="field-value" data-field="eligible_amount">{{ eligible_amount }}</span></p>
    <p>HEALTH CLUB RECEIPT INCLUDED? <span class="field-value" data-field="receipt_included">{{ receipt_included }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section" style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <p>The reimbursement for the health club membership is a taxable amount and will be paid to you on your next available payroll check. Maximum amount reimbursable is <span data-field="max_reimbursable_amount">{{ max_reimbursable_amount }}</span> per 12-month period.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 80px;">
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <p>WesternU Employee Signature</p>
      <div class="signature-line" data-field="westernu_employee_signature">{{ westernu_employee_signature }}</div>
      <p style="margin-top: 5px;">Date: <span data-field="employee_signature_date">{{ employee_signature_date }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <p>Verified by OHR Representative</p>
      <div class="signature-line" data-field="verified_by_ohr_representative">{{ verified_by_ohr_representative }}</div>
      <p style="margin-top: 5px;">Date: <span data-field="ohr_verification_date">{{ ohr_verification_date }}</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>